//cf.geekdo-images.com/n3qOvij3pHfF9TNfkvujYQ__previewthumb/img/RaYAwFoIRCYZq3sNA2PkKpneO94=/fit-in/300x320/filters:strip_icc()/pic9813272.png","desc":"Return to the world of Arcadia Quest in this narrative co-op adventure.","name":"Fable Quest","year":2027,"cover":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/n3qOvij3pHfF9TNfkvujYQ__itemrep@2x/img/rq6KRfytAemFnRgnBoEQuEaZFbI=/fit-in/492x600/filters:strip_icc()/pic9813272.png","about":["Fable Quest is a story-driven, fully cooperative game set in the enchanting world of Arcadia Quest, taking place after the epic events of the beloved saga.","For the first time in Arcadia, players are not rival guilds competing for glory, you stand together. Through card-driven gameplay, a touch of deck-building, and meaningful narrative choices, you'll explore the whimsical realms of Arcadia not as conquerors, but as participants in its unfolding story.","You'll meet its people, you'll face its dangers, and your decisions will shape how your adventure evolves - together.","—description from the publisher"],"mechs":["Action Points","Cooperative Game","Grid Movement","Hand Management","Line of Sight","Modular Board","Scenario / Mission / Campaign Game","Square Grid"],"cats":["Adventure","Exploration","Fantasy","Fighting","Miniatures"],"by":["Guilherme Goulart","Fred Perret"],"pics":[{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/sTwJBDqPw9VTFEc97mZQdA__small@2x/img/kkdUJIIlRgnWa3HSbeWpb6YFvoo=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9813271.png","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/sTwJBDqPw9VTFEc97mZQdA__large/img/YhczwEA30dJtsMGxeDutlWlQmLU=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9813271.png","c":"Fable Quest game setup"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/n3qOvij3pHfF9TNfkvujYQ__small@2x/img/FKLggtAwkLSrdnpGKnLdxoIOJac=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9813272.png","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/n3qOvij3pHfF9TNfkvujYQ__large/img/H-00EpDQoGll3SyXdCEuJ5qvMts=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9813272.png","c":"Fable Quest box art"}],"camp":{"rel":"","relst":"unreleased","since":"2026-11-03T23:24:31Z","on":"gamefound","url":"https://gamefound.com/en/projects/tabletop-tycoon/fable-quest","ver":"804864","ends":"2026-11-20T01:00:00+00:00","pct":749,"backers":741,"pledged":149831,"cur":"USD","more":[]}},{"id":459201,"minp":1,"maxp":5,"tmin":45,"tmax":60,"weight":2.25,"rating":8.0,"owned":17,"img":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/fl-c2zz7fIJQonLPBhvr_Q__previewthumb/img/PbjtFDvS7gAgde44waYLnRLx97E=/fit-in/300x320/filters:strip_icc()/pic9717753.jpg","desc":"Experience the thrill of leading your own space company to victory!","name":"Payload","year":2027,"cover":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/fl-c2zz7fIJQonLPBhvr_Q__itemrep@2x/img/VmnxQhxegXnz7-pR2J6jlBS3IIM=/fit-in/492x600/filters:strip_icc()/pic9717753.jpg","about":["Payload 🚀 is a tactical strategy card game where you run your own space company. Compete for valuable Payload contracts, build ambitious rockets, hire skilled Engineers, and launch at the perfect moment. Every decision matters. Build too slowly and your rivals may end the game first. Launch too early, and your rocket may not be ready.","You don't need to know rocket science to play. The game is easy to learn, while drawing inspiration from real rocket engineering to create a fun and competitive experience.","The game in brief:","Payload is for 1-5 players, ages 14 and up, and plays in about 45-60 minutes.","Your goal is to score the most victory points by launching Payloads, building a strong team of Engineers, saving Rocket Parts, and managing your money well.","Each game begins with players checking the weather at the launch pad. Next, players start bidding for valuable Payload contracts. Winning the right contract earns you money and shapes the rocket you want to build. As the game unfolds, you'll buy Rocket Parts, hire Engineers, improve your rocket, and use special Operations to stay one step ahead of your rivals.","Every turn feels like a step toward liftoff as players block, outthink, and outbuild each other. And when your rocket is finally ready, everything comes down to the final countdown. The launch is a big decision. A stronger rocket is safer, but waiting too long could cost you the game. Launch at the right moment, roll the dice, and see if your Payload reaches orbit.","Payload stays true to real rocket concepts but keeps everything simple and fun (and competitive!).","-description from designer"],"mechs":["Auction / Bidding","Automatic Resource Growth","Contracts","Dice Rolling","End Game Bonuses","Market","Open Drafting","Push Your Luck","Race","Set Collection","Trading"],"cats":["Card Game","Dice","Educational"],"by":["Ashutosh Kumar","Arjit Raj"],"pics":[{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/ONniFD_KZh5QsB4J2td5Kw__small@2x/img/xNI-tMyaDKahIKec5uKxQ35YodY=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9715229.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/ONniFD_KZh5QsB4J2td5Kw__large/img/klVkswjTFRBgz40aDbVlWQRJvlQ=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9715229.jpg","c":"Payload Box Cover"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/CCj1hZmbGZFdXYRBWPX2xw__small@2x/img/op3KSBOvzGEsz5SCavnqhJyk2Us=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9573633.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/CCj1hZmbGZFdXYRBWPX2xw__large/img/hjY6Oj7PYkSxH2uTZYfVpFzO5kU=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9573633.jpg","c":"Rocket almost finished"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/PMbahD11RZ8DTt_LIKhzFQ__small@2x/img/GOYTSeZKFR1dKF_vFBxwxH5y2Aw=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9573632.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/PMbahD11RZ8DTt_LIKhzFQ__large/img/_w44uiyvKUh8s5pzQZiVbAoe6hQ=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9573632.jpg","c":"Assembling the rocket"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/3bcLXKj4d5y0Q2CrMprdyQ__small@2x/img/c3rRRYr2tnWQFyv7YRtZQlQRoDY=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9573631.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/3bcLXKj4d5y0Q2CrMprdyQ__large/img/ifv54PNwB9nK2Hk90vI-udtVmSk=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9573631.jpg","c":"Example of player area"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/omxike5UbmCbKUAAzYrVog__small@2x/img/n_iR95ckQGjGILHdU_diW_8YwdQ=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9573630.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/omxike5UbmCbKUAAzYrVog__large/img/ctT-lfqsZm5rAxiXypNn3oQUIkA=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9573630.jpg","c":"Common area"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/_MXWVP0dsF3WRVV_Yvwxxg__small@2x/img/iuz9NdQ3Xa-I_Lbzlvv7nx_zGQM=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9573629.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/_MXWVP0dsF3WRVV_Yvwxxg__large/img/EdMtc2qyaYsB1SpwCYFJAWVBoJc=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9573629.jpg","c":"Player aid"}],"camp":{"rel":"2027-03","relst":"unreleased","since":"2026-10-21T17:03:36Z","on":"kickstarter","url":"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/rajarjit/payload","ver":"819380","ends":"2026-11-20T03:00:00+00:00","pct":383,"backers":174,"pledged":5739,"cur":"USD","more":[]}},{"id":460093,"minp":1,"maxp":4,"tmin":60,"tmax":90,"weight":0.0,"rating":8.3,"owned":2,"img":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/WcnDCN9BnAWoM_XwaHB-xg__previewthumb/img/NB-8QGaNRuh_kHe2oY9I1Cs650U=/fit-in/300x320/filters:strip_icc()/pic9517864.jpg","desc":"Mischievous cats work together to take control of their house","cover":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/WcnDCN9BnAWoM_XwaHB-xg__itemrep@2x/img/7MRQSO4u64VbTVhMpdlEOUv3RKo=/fit-in/492x600/filters:strip_icc()/pic9517864.jpg","about":["Good Kitties is a cooperative strategy game where you play as mischievous house cats bent on taking control of the house while your humans sleep. In each mission, you'll move through the house collecting supplies, building inventive contraptions, and using those contraptions to complete your mission objectives before the humans wake up. Feel like a cat as you wiggle to increase your attack power, scratch the furniture to gain supplies, and make a ruckus as you zoom through the house.","Along the way, you'll need to catch mice, both to power up your cats and to keep those sneaky mice from completing their own secret plot inside the walls. You'll also need to evade the pesky dog, who's always trying to disrupt your plans. Better yet, maybe you can find a way to blame the dog for the mess you left behind...","Good Kitties comes with 6 escalating missions that can be played in order or standalone, plus content to mix up your missions each time you play. Start with simple missions to destroy houseplants, and advance towards impressive feats like creating pocket dimensions to hide in. Every mission comes in its own tuckbox, with custom tokens and fun new rules.","—description from the publisher"],"mechs":["Action Queue","Action Retrieval","Cooperative Game","Grid Movement","Scenario / Mission / Campaign Game","Variable Player Powers","Variable Set-up"],"cats":["Animals"],"by":["Emily Vincent"],"pics":[{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/WcnDCN9BnAWoM_XwaHB-xg__small@2x/img/dPbL3w7O7HTXNYgl63joJiskjdI=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9517864.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/WcnDCN9BnAWoM_XwaHB-xg__large/img/bK5JCH80Eqcit0-BMVm2Lwht-Cs=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9517864.jpg","c":"Box Cover"}],"name":"Good Kitties","year":2027,"camp":{"rel":"2027-06","relst":"unreleased","since":"2026-10-20T17:12:34Z","on":"kickstarter","url":"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/pinkhawkgames/good-kitties-super-chonk","ver":"783404","ends":"2026-11-20T08:00:00+00:00","pct":502,"backers":493,"pledged":48212,"cur":"USD","more":["Super Chonk"]}},{"id":466790,"minp":2,"maxp":4,"tmin":90,"tmax":240,"weight":3.0,"rating":8.9,"owned":5,"img":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/XAKfgrTga_yZR1MefiwHGg__previewthumb/img/jNEQIwxB7s95_jqFQOhlp4UvQXM=/fit-in/300x320/filters:strip_icc()/pic9765206.jpg","desc":"Transport goods, build fleets and factories, and create the greatest shipping empire.","name":"Ports of Call: The Board Game","year":2027,"cover":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/XAKfgrTga_yZR1MefiwHGg__itemrep@2x/img/smyQgQkzMIMqIPfRCQMYnJNqvmY=/fit-in/492x600/filters:strip_icc()/pic9765206.jpg","about":["Ports of Call: The Board Game brings the classic 1987 computer game, created by Rolf-Dieter Klein and Martin Ulrich, to the tabletop.","Players compete to build the world's most valuable shipping company by transporting goods across the oceans, fulfilling commercial orders, establishing factories, and expanding their maritime empires.","Starting with two ships, a home port, and limited financial resources, players must navigate international trade routes, manage their fleets, and make strategic investments, while dealing with pirates, rats, unpredictable weather, closed ports, and smuggling.","The winner is the player who, by the end of the game, has built the most valuable shipping company.","A World of Trade and Opportunity","The game features 15 port cities connected by shipping routes across the globe. Five commodities – wind turbines, steel, electronics, wine, and oil – form the foundation of international trade.","Each port specialises in producing one commodity, creating a worldwide network of trading opportunities. Players purchase containers, transport them between cities, and sell their cargo for profit.","One of the main objectives is to fulfil commercial orders. Each Order Card requires two specific commodities to be delivered to a designated port. Players must plan efficient routes, acquire the necessary goods, and coordinate their ships to complete these contracts and increase their company's value.","Build Your Fleet and Industrial Network","As their businesses grow, players can invest in additional ships and establish factories in port cities around the world.","Small ships are inexpensive and efficient, while large ships offer greater cargo capacity at higher purchase and maintenance costs. Expanding your fleet increases your transportation capabilities but also creates additional financial obligations.","Factories allow players to produce their own containers and supply goods to the global Container Terminal, a shared marketplace where commodity prices fluctuate as containers are added and purchased.","When another player purchases a container you have produced, you receive the payment. Producing goods also advances your position on the Production Track, unlocking valuable bonuses.","Players must decide whether to focus on shipping contracts, industrial production, commodity trading, or a combination of these strategies.","Strategic Decisions and Economic Challenges","Each player manages their company through an individual Office Board and a limited number of Action Points.","…"],"mechs":["Action Points","Commodity Speculation","End Game Bonuses","Events","Investment","Market","Movement Points","Pick-up and Deliver","Point to Point Movement","Turn Order: Progressive","Victory Points as a Resource"],"cats":["Economic","Industry / Manufacturing","Transportation","Video Game Theme"],"by":["Keld V. Rasmussen"],"pics":[{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/XAKfgrTga_yZR1MefiwHGg__small@2x/img/JDUH18SEImezefIfqEsrsl-xNLk=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9765206.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/XAKfgrTga_yZR1MefiwHGg__large/img/6dqDBsniErXsEA7FyisuDesljJk=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9765206.jpg","c":"Final box art"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/RQGlAzYj8BKZ0Yr9ULy60w__small@2x/img/meg8aABQGAsMZVjG2O-RtBGh_wk=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9838535.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/RQGlAzYj8BKZ0Yr9ULy60w__large/img/0pCBV4y8-zwr3HX1KLZEZ6_ggA4=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9838535.jpg","c":"A 4 player game with plenty of shipping activity."},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/i-av8ZMnKmJ9bHS24lDZQg__small@2x/img/qWhguznrTx3e9rjYNWYx3D8SiuQ=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9838539.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/i-av8ZMnKmJ9bHS24lDZQg__large/img/oXR8VjE-ZlGIdiLntB42r6phOEg=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9838539.jpg","c":"Heavy shipping activity in the Indian Ocean."},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/WWOrctSQDsbaN0nPcjmJ2w__small@2x/img/vmoVrrgOflCXwDJMxOsTjXzMUos=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9838538.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/WWOrctSQDsbaN0nPcjmJ2w__large/img/kX2VBP8YxWINwCvm04U_gS2w3b0=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9838538.jpg","c":"A view from Blue Player's home city, Cape Town."},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/x5AQqLM9OWGuy79gnFnsdg__small@2x/img/PLWUynbbpJ031837sa3flLTOeH0=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9838537.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/x5AQqLM9OWGuy79gnFnsdg__large/img/gVl343rMPUsJ4a5LGjUaWtfbV3U=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9838537.jpg","c":"So many orders to complete in the last quarters of the game!"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/Iw7oU0GhkqNbZ9U8Sn1cWg__small@2x/img/dpziSHzmNnvaHwnJTSbvkuHZ-9E=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9838536.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/Iw7oU0GhkqNbZ9U8Sn1cWg__large/img/e8smvLeOEXmNolZA2oTypPR-CVU=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9838536.jpg","c":"A view from Red Player's office."}],"camp":{"rel":"2027-08","relst":"unreleased","since":"2026-11-05T06:48:27Z","on":"kickstarter","url":"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gameinventors/ports-of-call-the-board-game","ver":"794744","ends":"2026-11-20T09:05:32+00:00","pct":283,"backers":499,"pledged":28316,"cur":"EUR","more":[]}},{"id":419843,"minp":2,"maxp":6,"tmin":20,"tmax":35,"weight":1.4,"rating":8.3,"owned":133,"img":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/TQ7XurFxHzv_alNyEZOBYQ__previewthumb/img/oF4-181yf3h6iwSTKW6NPg-17xI=/fit-in/300x320/filters:strip_icc()/pic8331242.jpg","desc":"A quick play card game about fantasy snakes embarking on bizarre quests.","name":"Quest Snakes","year":2025,"cover":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/TQ7XurFxHzv_alNyEZOBYQ__itemrep@2x/img/4k9KBoB9dkinGTQC-i7QI-NER9c=/fit-in/492x600/filters:strip_icc()/pic8331242.jpg","about":["In Quest Snakes, you take on the role of a guild leader tasked to recruit heroic snakes into your ranks.","In the first phase of the game, players will take turns hiring pairs of Snakes. Once you have a guild of 10 snakes, you enter the second phase.","In the second phase, quests are posted one at a time, offering loot to the strongest guild. Guild leaders will assemble a party of Snakes in secrecy. Once parties are assembled, guilds reveal their snakes. Snakes have power values assigned to them, and the party with the most power wins. But be aware, some classes of Snakes are better equipped for certain quests. And snakes need to rest after the questing - the stronger the Snake, the more turns they rest.","The guild with the most loot after a set number of Quests wins!","—description from the publisher"],"mechs":["Auction / Bidding","Hand Management","Highest-Lowest Scoring","Role Playing"],"cats":["Bluffing","Card Game","Fantasy","Humor","Party Game"],"by":[],"pics":[{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/TQ7XurFxHzv_alNyEZOBYQ__small@2x/img/C68A5SKz-vZytJkEAHh-WOC5m5k=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic8331242.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/TQ7XurFxHzv_alNyEZOBYQ__large/img/KDkPoLhgTE8Op-a52KcLeyyowuw=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic8331242.jpg","c":"Updated Kickstarter Key Art"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/WpJesFoXPvFGUU5kry-6iQ__small@2x/img/01UBdmZMzHIKkNPMrrzaqxrzAsI=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9367267.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/WpJesFoXPvFGUU5kry-6iQ__large/img/WNCi0sH-v7YkKk5vEVEcdD5TDEY=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9367267.jpg","c":"Quest Snakes"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/IzLvl2921hocaz6J2W_ORg__small@2x/img/65Q_9L25soHokba8GRNErCgprSI=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9367266.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/IzLvl2921hocaz6J2W_ORg__large/img/cHUwn3vtx-yfWy4VlsrM1QqrPrk=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9367266.jpg","c":"Quest Snakes"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/K7F0uor48FLObHVDTkNC3Q__small@2x/img/hMqt0V56XYax-nbqrBOxb_EufAE=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9367265.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/K7F0uor48FLObHVDTkNC3Q__large/img/vbawkcegdbN4_sOLfyeFZhlpSEM=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9367265.jpg","c":"Quest Snakes"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/dFM6uj8s6DP8WZneEBcyOg__small@2x/img/NwcGbFO6OP1wIzY6SYOoWAdJ5tU=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9367264.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/dFM6uj8s6DP8WZneEBcyOg__large/img/xB0BJqg2W8yzaVKl1joemkc1hZs=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9367264.jpg","c":"Quest Snakes"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/jy8UY9gDRJnUaP6bI2ug6w__small@2x/img/mvAy0odC_q5gDiPNFRYQsLlhafM=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9367263.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/jy8UY9gDRJnUaP6bI2ug6w__large/img/l4kWfIsfGBmx2VWY7blO-LESy8M=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9367263.jpg","c":"Quest Snakes"}],"camp":{"rel":"2025-06","relst":"unreleased","since":"2026-11-06T19:25:22Z","on":"kickstarter","url":"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/realfakegames/quest-snakes-wanderers","ver":"711738","ends":"2026-11-20T14:00:00+00:00","pct":971,"backers":723,"pledged":97090,"cur":"USD","more":[]}},{"id":478186,"minp":4,"maxp":12,"tmin":15,"tmax":30,"weight":0.0,"rating":0.0,"owned":2,"img":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/xQ8rXuDKKTeONZ2eq2x2eg__previewthumb/img/Ncp5xPx8WzHjUtF2bgYPs66dt9Y=/fit-in/300x320/filters:strip_icc()/pic9775415.png","desc":"Find the thief hidden amongst you!","name":"Deception: Heist in Hong Kong","year":2027,"cover":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/xQ8rXuDKKTeONZ2eq2x2eg__itemrep@2x/img/OGQ1NQ0-hNu70fc9BQNYhmx9wLc=/fit-in/492x600/filters:strip_icc()/pic9775415.png","about":["In bustling Hong Kong, a string of thefts has the police on edge. The items stolen range from the usual high-end fare to the seemingly mundane; a mastermind behind each theft has been taunting local authorities. Now, you and your fellow Investigators have received a tip (perhaps from the culprit himself) about a new theft that reveals the location of the robbery and the nature of the stolen item - nothing more! Having arrived at the scene of the crime, It is now up to you to discover what exactly the “Stolen Object” was and also to identify the \"Key Evidence\" at the scene that will allow you to convict the thief!","As if solving a crime wasn't tricky enough, this one is complicated by the fact that the thief is among the Investigators! While the Forensic Scientist gives Investigators clues on what to look for, the thief attempts to sow confusion and doubt to cover their crime Will the Investigators be perceptive enough to successfully solve the heist or will the culprit(s) get away with another lucrative score?","Deception: Heist in Hong Kong is a new game modeled on the Deception: Murder in Hong Kong system that brings new crimes to your table to solve - or get away with!","Deception: Heist in Hong Kong offers tons of features for long time fans to brand-new players alike!","Completely Stand-Alone Game","Fun & Approachable Heist Theme","Plays in 15-30 minutes","Great for groups from 4-12 players","Mix and Match Games!","Key Evidence Cards from Deception: Heist in Hong Kong and Deception: Murder in Hong Kong can be swapped and used in either game (or even mixed together) for millions of new potential combinations.","—description from the publisher"],"mechs":["Communication Limits","Deduction","Events","Finale Ending","Hidden Roles","Roles with Asymmetric Information","Storytelling","Team-Based Game","Traitor Game","Variable Set-up"],"cats":["Bluffing","Deduction","Party Game"],"by":["Tobey Ho"],"pics":[{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/xQ8rXuDKKTeONZ2eq2x2eg__small@2x/img/rwlhCXYNS5xAo6Qfw6r17EZ-JBo=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9775415.png","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/xQ8rXuDKKTeONZ2eq2x2eg__large/img/08EUUvGOlKoedGobfkXImZudOHY=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9775415.png","c":"Box Cover Image"}],"camp":{"rel":"","relst":"unreleased","since":"2026-10-29T05:49:42Z","on":"kickstarter","url":"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/152730994/deception-heist-in-hong-kong","ver":"814005","ends":"2026-11-20T16:00:00+00:00","pct":301,"backers":920,"pledged":45131,"cur":"USD","more":[]}},{"id":480446,"minp":1,"maxp":4,"tmin":120,"tmax":720,"weight":0.0,"rating":10.0,"owned":0,"img":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/hPKTWoDYroMZ00--qLniYA__previewthumb/img/Y0pX5b8cdZWmQLCjxPU35Ayq0pc=/fit-in/300x320/filters:strip_icc()/pic9844684.png","desc":"A colony of vengeful rats work together to conquer the city of Ravensridge.","name":"One Thousand Rats Devour a City","year":2027,"cover":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/hPKTWoDYroMZ00--qLniYA__itemrep@2x/img/vfKab3IwfECAntNiN9zV0P5JrFE=/fit-in/492x600/filters:strip_icc()/pic9844684.png","about":["One Thousand Rats Devour a City is a roleplaying game-boardgame hybrid for 1–4 players about a colony of rats conquering a Victorian Gothic city. Take on the role of your own alpha rat and work with your kin to grow your colony, expand your territory, and drive out humanity from the city.","Play is broken down into rounds comprising 3 steps: Event, Action, and Colony. During the event step, you will draw a card to see how the city reacts to your deadly colony, and potentially trigger previously drawn event cards. In the action step, you will send your swarms of rats and your horde of alpha rats on missions to sabotage the city, consume locations, pilfer resources, and thwart threats. Finally, in the colony step, you will gain resources from the territories your colony controls and make sure all your rats are fed before starting a new round.","To win the game, you must capture points of interest in the city before your colony collapses due to a lack of resources or threats from the city an opposing factions.","—description from the publisher"],"mechs":["Action Points","Area Majority / Influence","Cooperative Game","Critical Hits and Failures","Dice Rolling","Events","Income","Paper-and-Pencil","Role Playing","Solo / Solitaire Game","Variable Set-up"],"cats":["Adventure","Fantasy"],"by":["Brandon Lee (II)","Nicholas Robinia"],"pics":[{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/_eyjktVJRMXYSnTs8vO8Ng__small@2x/img/f51nmJdZFQ-Nwa_gHOaKO6RYBHs=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9844686.png","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/_eyjktVJRMXYSnTs8vO8Ng__large/img/IOLqKIVAxWR8O92Q7-7ZLTKtQIU=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9844686.png","c":"One Thousand Rats Devour a City, The Ravensridge Emporium 2026 – Alpha rat art showcase"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/g00uEc4ftyzrblUUp2oBjA__small@2x/img/Fyd9EBQ-ntbkx6Jl4yPyqBkGoVI=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9844685.png","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/g00uEc4ftyzrblUUp2oBjA__large/img/_QSw6gQROXMZxb1IZYt41U5aqTA=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9844685.png","c":"One Thousand Rats Devour a City, The Ravensridge Emporium 2026 – Mid-game state of the game with prototype print"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/hPKTWoDYroMZ00--qLniYA__small@2x/img/2D4hcK087rYWR0hZYfji_0VEVMQ=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9844684.png","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/hPKTWoDYroMZ00--qLniYA__large/img/iulHfrMoxQ8Kp1oWmDQ1_6_Vms0=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9844684.png","c":"One Thousand Rats Devour a City, The Ravensridge Emporium 2026 – Box Cover"}],"camp":{"rel":"2027-09","relst":"unreleased","since":"2026-11-03T00:59:11Z","on":"kickstarter","url":"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/ravensridge/one-thousand-rats-devour-a-city","ver":"817975","ends":"2026-11-20T18:00:00+00:00","pct":380,"backers":716,"pledged":114148,"cur":"AUD","more":[]}},{"id":477935,"minp":2,"maxp":4,"tmin":90,"tmax":120,"weight":0.0,"rating":9.5,"owned":1,"img":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/5DJsED7inZvW6MCCUge94w__previewthumb/img/FeAfKjTqzM-pMpOFIvoFoySuLXo=/fit-in/300x320/filters:strip_icc()/pic9775349.png","desc":"Race across space, take on powerful criminals, and become Cosmic Cowboy.","cover":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/5DJsED7inZvW6MCCUge94w__itemrep@2x/img/6Yf5EB34AM-z6BYuLr8V4yHcpYw=/fit-in/492x600/filters:strip_icc()/pic9775349.png","about":["Cosmic Cowboy is a worker-placement game where players take on the role of bounty hunters competing to capture outlaws, upgrade planets, and earn the most valuable bounties.","On your turn, place one of your action markers on an available action tile to perform that action. An action tile can only contain one player's action marker at a time, so you'll need to plan around the actions your opponents take.","The galaxy is filled with outlaws displayed on wanted posters on the main board. Choose which outlaw you want to capture, then pay the required cost in henchman tokens. Outlaws higher up on the board offer greater bounties and more powerful special effects, but they also cost more to capture. Capturing outlaws earns you bounties and can give you special abilities to help you throughout the game.","You can also use your actions to upgrade planets. Pay the required cost in henchman tokens to upgrade a planet revealed on the main board. Planet upgrades provide permanent benefits that can make your future actions more efficient.","Once all players have used their action markers, the action phase is refreshed and the markers are collected. The next round then begins.","Cosmic Cowboy is played over 8 rounds, or 7 rounds in a 4-player game. At the end of the final round, the player who with the highest total victory points wins the game and claims the title of the galaxy's greatest bounty hunter: the Cosmic Cowboy!","—description from the publisher"],"mechs":["Worker Placement"],"cats":["Space Exploration"],"by":["N2"],"pics":[{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/vgWY-GxkrjaRqxnBztZRqA__small@2x/img/Blvziaod4LjESVLJigA7P4AKdQo=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9859626.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/vgWY-GxkrjaRqxnBztZRqA__large/img/9PTucbK_PWkeqwszo-3gCTgR-gU=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9859626.jpg","c":"Cosmic Cowboy Rocket Ship"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/_fUwhXrEsM4P8vnPVsKfCA__small@2x/img/8k1m2HjZ9NMkzki121sepxPKq4k=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9859625.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/_fUwhXrEsM4P8vnPVsKfCA__large/img/xKQ5AluAI_pQHV5FVCAtBhECmoc=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9859625.jpg","c":"Cosmic Cowboy Token Board"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/TeDr0Hn2Ys8qbzvqCuAl4A__small@2x/img/9BqLlID0zu9b67qPWyVRgCllO68=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9859624.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/TeDr0Hn2Ys8qbzvqCuAl4A__large/img/G0uJT_VHcPbWVJOEEHAp4UuKR5I=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9859624.jpg","c":"Cosmic Cowboy Token"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/OcNqc-rvaxw0l5FtmN82lA__small@2x/img/4Medk4xh9k3CMYe1d5Xr33BP7hc=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9859623.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/OcNqc-rvaxw0l5FtmN82lA__large/img/UAf6_CqhDvFD-BdEGFonlneeDCg=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9859623.jpg","c":"Cosmic Cowboy Player Board"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/7ZlaXG-VejK8bY7rC3xB_A__small@2x/img/RktA5JWAbodfj6qfNtPlgrxHtOo=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9859622.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/7ZlaXG-VejK8bY7rC3xB_A__large/img/fTRFbj2seThCSluyMZOg6INa-AQ=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9859622.jpg","c":"Cosmic Cowboy Bounty Board"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/YwNv4fNX6Q5FvdH5JmWu9g__small@2x/img/6utGmzsf91rdpQI6qmZumFFElb4=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9859621.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/YwNv4fNX6Q5FvdH5JmWu9g__large/img/cLzK6pMnFa5IrN_uA39QP32UQfg=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9859621.jpg","c":"Cosmic Cowboy Tabletop Game"}],"name":"Cosmic Cowboy","year":2026,"camp":{"rel":"","relst":"unreleased","since":"2026-10-20T17:12:34Z","on":"kickstarter","url":"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/mugengaming/cosmic-cowboy-1","ver":"813585","ends":"2026-11-20T18:00:00+00:00","pct":463,"backers":547,"pledged":36503,"cur":"USD","more":[]}},{"id":480145,"minp":2,"maxp":8,"tmin":15,"tmax":30,"weight":0.0,"rating":0.0,"owned":0,"img":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/Fyyiw206fMfj6-XRP5Cq6A__previewthumb/img/M7rk1GYKYoCJv10tPoV1afkXweI=/fit-in/300x320/filters:strip_icc()/pic9843212.png","desc":"Players guess when 250 inventions arrived and race to build their own timeline.","name":"TAP 10: Inventions 1875-2025","year":2027,"cover":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/Fyyiw206fMfj6-XRP5Cq6A__itemrep@2x/img/IZAsQ__J4nhw-mOxiVLlhgAKqq8=/fit-in/492x600/filters:strip_icc()/pic9843212.png","about":["TAP 10: Inventions is a fast timeline card game about 250 inventions from 1875 to 2025. One side of every card shows the invention, the other shows the year it arrived. Everyone knows the invention. The year is the hard part.","On your turn you draw a card and tap the spot where you think it belongs in your own timeline, then flip it to reveal the year. Guess right and the card stays and your timeline grows. Guess wrong and it is discarded. Think an opponent has placed a card wrong? Spend a Eureka Token to challenge, put the card where you believe it truly belongs, and claim it if you are right.","The first player to place ten cards in the correct order wins. There are two ways to play: Classic is turn-based, with everyone watching and ready to challenge, while Blitz is real time, where all players go at once and the round stops the second someone shouts TAP 10.","The box contains 250 invention cards, 30 Eureka Tokens, 3 tuck boxes and a rulebook.","—description from the publisher"],"mechs":["Ordering","Real-Time"],"cats":["Card Game","Educational","Party Game","Trivia"],"by":["Mikaela Hård","Lucas Vagner"],"pics":[{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/Fyyiw206fMfj6-XRP5Cq6A__small@2x/img/QVjM7qs4omm8zuzCFc-jRUhv7tw=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9843212.png","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/Fyyiw206fMfj6-XRP5Cq6A__large/img/7XifNtd9BfBDLCnoUv5ChLTBmcU=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9843212.png","c":"Box design"}],"camp":{"rel":"","relst":"unreleased","since":"2026-11-03T23:24:31Z","on":"kickstarter","url":"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/npg/tap-10-inventions","ver":"817354","ends":"2026-11-20T19:00:00+00:00","pct":791,"backers":190,"pledged":7909,"cur":"EUR","more":[]}},{"id":429150,"minp":2,"maxp":5,"tmin":90,"tmax":120,"weight":3.5,"rating":8.0,"owned":5,"img":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/aWFge2ollkXMib8I8fTjDA__previewthumb/img/tMoYjCuUvmtQs2JMC_xVtriUnJk=/fit-in/300x320/filters:strip_icc()/pic9467121.jpg","desc":"Uncertainty, trust and synergy. A frantic quest for freedom regardless of all risks!","name":"Panopticon","year":2027,"cover":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/aWFge2ollkXMib8I8fTjDA__itemrep@2x/img/ZgXweoaCr0RQAQWfNVFpcg1260k=/fit-in/492x600/filters:strip_icc()/pic9467121.jpg","about":["A cooperative and immersive experience in which you must coordinate as best you can by taking advantage of every glimpse from the lines of sight and overhearing every bit of information.","The game is divided into 3 days, each of which consists of 4 rounds. At each turn, players use up to 3 action points and, clockwise, choose whether to perform 1 or 2 actions until they run out of tokens.","During your turn you can move within the Panopticon, interact with rooms to activate or inspect them, or talk to prisoners you encounter.","Different actions carry an associated risk, to be checked by flipping the cards of the Panopticon deck. The risk will be gradual and will increase day by day.","It is necessary to survive all together until the final showdown, otherwise the game will be lost before any escape attempt is made.","The heart of the game is to discover and execute at least 4 out of 5 phases of the same escape plan by dropping resource cards to accomplish the demands of the prisoners who possess this information.","In the meanwhile you will create objects in the workshop to dig a tunnel or damage the electrical system. You will whisper a prayer in the chapel and maybe you will take on a temporary job...","Communication is prohibited, but you can take advantage of lines of sight and adjacencies to cooperate and coordinate in order to acquire as much knowledge as possible by lowering the risk. Should the plan be too fragmented, you will have to gather in one room to interact, at the risk of being spotted.","The perception of control will be defeated: run away from the Panopticon!","Will you be able to grasp your new freedom, or will you die at your last step?","-description from developer"],"mechs":["Acting","Action / Event","Cooperative Game","Deduction","Line of Sight","Movement Points","Multi-Use Cards"],"cats":["Deduction","Exploration","Political","Puzzle"],"by":["Christian Costanzo","Emanuele Gemme","Carlo Alberto Iocco"],"pics":[{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/wW7eV2MtTvYYhNDGi4yf_w__small@2x/img/-vGRWENC1Cjov4ebrihT63_GHz4=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9467133.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/wW7eV2MtTvYYhNDGi4yf_w__large/img/sLx5biF7MldcQG4AgDABevaBbTQ=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9467133.jpg","c":"Panopticon - Resource tokens + cards"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/lIcscGdIrylQQUyrYqFp8A__small@2x/img/3w4EoD8cwhLI9IVxKX5wz9RdkSk=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9467123.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/lIcscGdIrylQQUyrYqFp8A__large/img/0vU8zAR-W1P_e9NYtLj0rkR_MBk=/fit-in/1024x1024/filters:no_upscale():strip_icc()/pic9467123.jpg","c":"Panopticon - Main Board Detail"},{"s":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/70kT83tEssYU33tNl4OkLA__small@2x/img/fDeojoHnU3mQVLaOuOwLJNo8w80=/fit-in/400x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic9467119.jpg","l":"https://cf.geekdo-images.com/70kT83tEssY